<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-WELLINGTON BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 19-3.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WELLINGTON BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 19-3.</headline>
<dateline>NAPIER, New Zealand 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Wellington Hurricanes beat the New South Wales Waratahs 19-3 (halftime 12- 3) in a Super 12 match at McLean Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Wellington - Tries: Christian Cullen, Martin Leslie, Jason O'Halloran; Conversions: Cullen (2).</p>
<p>New South Wales - Penalty: Matthew Burke.</p>
